<section class="dash-panel first-success <%= continuity.retrieved?'continuity-complete':'' %>" data-continuity-state="<%= continuity.retrieved?'retrieved':continuity.saved?'saved':'new' %>">
<div><p class="overline">CONTEXT FOR YOUR NEXT CONVERSATION</p><h2><% if(continuity.retrieved) { %>Saved context retrieved.<% } else { %>One conversation.<br>A useful next one.<% } %></h2><p><%= continuity.retrieved?'Brain has returned saved context through a connected session. Your details, decisions, and open questions are ready to build on.':'Connect Brain once, save something useful, then pick it up in your next Sesame call or chat — with the same voice.' %></p>
<% if(!continuity.connected) { %><div class="copy-row"><code><%= config.resource %></code><button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy="<%= config.resource %>">Copy address</button></div><% } %><a class="panel-link" href="/docs">How to continue next time →</a></div>
<ol class="first-success-steps"><li class="<%= continuity.connected?'complete':'' %>"><span><%= continuity.connected?'✓':'1' %></span><div><strong>Connect once</strong><p><%= continuity.connected?'Your connection is ready. You can keep using the same one.':'In Sesame, add Brain under Agent Hub → Apps. One connection is enough.' %></p></div></li><li class="<%= continuity.saved?'complete':'' %>"><span><%= continuity.saved?'✓':'2' %></span><div><strong>Save what matters</strong><p><%= continuity.saved?'Saved context is available in this Brain.':'Ask: “Save in Brain that my morning train leaves at 7:40.” Use a detail that is true for you.' %></p></div></li><li class="<%= continuity.retrieved?'complete':'' %>"><span><%= continuity.retrieved?'✓':'3' %></span><div><strong><%= continuity.retrieved?'Saved context retrieved':'Pick it up next time' %></strong><p><%= continuity.retrieved?'Latest recorded retrieval: '+relativeTime(continuity.resumedAt)+'.':'On your next call or chat, ask the same voice: “Resume from Brain. Where did we leave off?”' %></p></div></li></ol>
<p class="onboarding-boundary">Brain carries forward information saved through its tools. A retrieval receipt does not verify a native Sesame call or capture every spoken word.</p>
</section>
